      "text": "/skill:tidy-recipe-authoring\n\nCreate tidy recipes for workbook `31e2342532122a2e8e9a3017ee4c5ce79cc74a6086f19d5c9550923697daa7b1--recorded-crime-offenders-2013-14-cube-5-source.xlsx`.\n\n- Publication: Recorded Crime — Offenders (Australian Bureau of Statistics)\n- Release or year: 2013-14\n- Sheets needing a recipe: 8 of 8\n\n| sheet | sheet_sha256 | current recipe |\n|---|---|---|\n| \"Contents\" | 4188c72507d3d6ec356de519c7e7c8265134212dc1967e8a40ded6e5017ab08f | missing |\n| \"Table_20\" | fbd061deb9bbb353cea53fdf6be3774486e81486eabbdde4cd315fc5077a7d00 | missing |\n| \"Table_21\" | 271c47e8f0b432cd80f2bf9b07190c895ebeb51abf26556c7b66095b8d885b7b | missing |\n| \"Table_22\" | f97160a5721fe84927115933291193208e5e03bb467b84756fbb9e6a73c0e5c0 | missing |\n| \"Table_23\" | abbfb28011dad4d27472fde6ada9874dc1547624240c12825c8f42b591dabf14 | missing |\n| \"Table_24\" | d19c130d06d4f2853c80fe839a26e4d82526b7c050b5729ebd201d16b8910053 | missing |\n| \"Table_25\" | 1a3fd60419b7d82b4b0c8d48c597bc014c53d96f758a12e346a4766e5dd9af7e | missing |\n| \"Table_26\" | e5971af3a73e161d4edf2e6660baa0c483e0e852025eedee0b58df4c68f1681b | missing |\n\nRelated workbooks:\n- None\n\nWork through every sheet listed above using the skill's workflow. Use\n`codemode` scripts to call the recipe tools, and batch the work: for example,\nlist the workbook and check templates for all sheets in one script, then read\ngrids and test recipes a few sheets at a time. Keep script output short.\n\nName dimensions from `dictionary/dimensions.csv` (see the skill's\n`references/naming.md`); declare any name it lacks in `new_dimensions`.\n\nWrite each recipe to `tidy-recipes/<sheet_sha256>.json` and finish every sheet\nwith `submit_recipe`. You may only write recipe files for this workbook.\n\nEnd with one line per sheet: `sheet | kind | status | records | remaining failures`."
